# public/build is intentionally tracked (not ignored) — deployment to
# shared hosting is git-pull-only, no Node available on the server, so
# the compiled Vite output has to travel through git itself. Rebuild
# locally (`npm run build`) and commit the changed files before every
# deploy; see README "Deploy steps".
